              22                     ! cloud micro - physics package for gfdl global cloud resolving model
              23                     ! the algorithms are originally derived from lin et al 1983. most of the
              24                     ! key elements have been simplified / improved. this code at this stage
              25                     ! bears little to no similarity to the original lin mp in zetac.
              26                     ! therefore, it is best to be called gfdl micro - physics (gfdl mp) .
              27                     ! developer: shian - jiann lin, linjiong zhou
              28                     ! =======================================================================
